# Mobile app settings (OPTIONAL).
#
# You normally don't need this file: when you run "npm run mobile", the app
# automatically talks to the API on the same computer (port 4000).
#
# Set this only if the automatic detection doesn't work for you, for example
# when using "expo start --tunnel" or a deployed API. To use it, copy this file
# to "mobile/.env", remove the # below and put in your computer's address.
# (Find it with "ipconfig" on Windows or "ipconfig getifaddr en0" on a Mac.)
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.20:4000
